@frame{Prose colons}:
    \textbf{Note}:
    The colon above owns no block, so the line is raw TeX.
    \emph{Caption}:
        An indented block turns the same shape into a structured command.
    @itemize:
        \item Summary:
        \item \textbf{Detail}:
          A shallower continuation line leaves the colon as text.
            \textbf{Deeper}:
    \cmd::
        - \textbf{Term}:
        - \textbf{Body}:
          continues on a continuation line
